From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mosip-vivid <vivid@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:27:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] liveness: resident face capture gated on liveness and
 bound to it

- BiometricCaptureScanBlockPortrait._scanBlock: for the Face attribute,
  run a RESIDENT liveness session before BiometricsApi.invokeDiscoverSbi;
  nothing is captured unless it passes (or policy disables it).
- BiometricsDetailsApi.parseRCaptureResponse: for Modality.FACE, the
  signed ISO 19794-5 image is decoded (IsoFaceImages) and matched off
  the main thread against the anchor embedding of the RESIDENT session
  that just passed (LivenessCaptureBinder -> LivenessPigeonApi.bindCapture).
  On a mismatch nothing is stored and invokeDiscoverSbi resolves with
  LIVENESS_CAPTURE_MISMATCH, which the widget reports.
- The landscape scan block (biometric_scan_middle_block.dart) is dead
  code in release-1.2.x and is not patched.
